the cotton candy machine,
棉花糖机，

07:12.367 --> 07:14.100
hot roasted peanuts,
热腾腾的烤花生，

07:14.200 --> 07:15.633
games of chance,
机会游戏，

07:15.733 --> 07:17.900
bottles you can knock over
to win a prize,
你可以打翻的瓶子
赢得奖品，

07:18.067 --> 07:20.267
the world's most exciting
roller coaster,
世界上最令人兴奋的
过山车,

07:20.367 --> 07:22.167
a deep fryer
for delicacies...
油炸锅
为了美味佳肴...

07:22.267 --> 07:23.633
- Delicacies?
- 美味佳肴？

07:23.733 --> 07:25.733
- And of course,
the dunking booth!
- 当然，
扣篮亭！

07:27.567 --> 07:28.933
[electric crackling]
[explosion booms]
[电击爆裂声]
[爆炸声]

07:29.067 --> 07:31.333
Uh,
have you seen the calliope?
呃，
你见过卡利俄佩吗？

07:31.433 --> 07:33.467
[calliope music plays]
[风琴音乐响起]

07:33.567 --> 07:34.500
- Aw...
- 噢...

07:34.600 --> 07:35.867
- Now look here,
Plankton.
- 现在看这里，
浮游生物。

07:35.967 --> 07:39.433
Me loyal employees
would never be taken in
我忠诚的员工
永远不会被接纳

07:39.533 --> 07:41.533
by such a shallow
display of--
由如此浅
显示--

07:41.633 --> 07:42.833
- One side, chubby!
- 一侧，胖乎乎的！

07:42.933 --> 07:44.200
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

07:44.300 --> 07:45.333
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:45.433 --> 07:49.067
- [chewing sounds]
- [咀嚼声]

07:50.300 --> 07:51.833
- Yum...
- 嗯...

07:51.933 --> 07:53.200
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:53.300 --> 07:54.767
Is this backwards?
这是倒退吗？

07:54.867 --> 07:57.133
No, that's not it either.
不，也不是这样。

07:57.233 --> 07:58.567
- You were saying, Krabs?
- 你是说，蟹蟹？

07:58.667 --> 08:00.667
- Mr. Krabs
is right, Plankton.
- 蟹老板
是的，浮游生物。

08:00.767 --> 08:03.233
We're having lots of fun.
Come on, Mr. Krabs.
我们玩得很开心。
来吧，蟹老板。

08:03.333 --> 08:06.867
- SpongeBob, would you mind
helping me with my zipper?
- 海绵宝宝，你介意吗
帮我拉拉链吗？

08:06.967 --> 08:09.767
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:09.867 --> 08:12.300
- Whoo-hoo-hoo!
Ha, ha!
- 呼呼呼！
哈，哈！

08:12.400 --> 08:14.167
- Who needs them,
right, Mr. Krabs?
- 谁需要它们，
对吧，蟹老板？

08:14.267 --> 08:16.433
- Huh?
Yeah, yeah, sure.
- 啊？
是的，是的，当然。

08:16.533 --> 08:19.700
- Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
[laughing]
- 呼呼呼！
[笑]

08:19.800 --> 08:21.367
- Do you want me
to paint your face?
- 你想要我吗
画你的脸？

08:21.467 --> 08:23.567
- Well, I don't know--
- 呃，我不知道--

08:23.667 --> 08:24.667
- All right.
- 好的。

08:24.767 --> 08:26.800
I'm making you into,
um, a ghost.
我要让你成为，
嗯，一个鬼。

08:26.900 --> 08:30.500
- Ooh, I think this mayo
has gone bad.
- 哦，我想这个蛋黄酱
已经变坏了。

08:30.600 --> 08:33.800
- Ooh, the ghost
of mayonnaise bad!
- 哦，幽灵
蛋黄酱不好！

08:33.900 --> 08:35.467
That really scares people.
这确实让人害怕。

08:35.567 --> 08:36.700
- Yeah.
[laughs weakly]
- 是的。
[虚弱地笑]

08:36.800 --> 08:38.067
- Whoa. Stop.
- 哇哦。停止。

08:38.100 --> 08:40.733
That is almost too much
cotton candy.
这几乎太多了
棉花糖。

08:40.833 --> 08:42.067
[electric crackling]
[电击爆裂声]

08:42.100 --> 08:44.233
[explosion booms]
[爆炸声]

08:44.333 --> 08:46.800
- You want to join in
all that fun over there
- 你想加入
那里很有趣

08:46.900 --> 08:48.700
with Mr. Squidward,
don't you?
和章鱼哥先生一起，
你不是吗？

08:48.800 --> 08:50.500
- No, of course not.
- 不，当然不是。

08:50.600 --> 08:52.833
- Are you sure
you don't want to?
- 你确定吗
你不想吗？

08:52.933 --> 08:54.667
- Mr. Krabs,
I am staying right here
- 蟹老板先生，
我就留在这里

08:54.767 --> 08:56.433
at the Krusty Krab picnic!
参加蟹堡王野餐！

08:56.533 --> 08:58.933
- You sure?
- 100% sure, Mr. Krabs!
- 你确定吗？
- 100%肯定，蟹老板！

08:59.067 --> 09:01.733
- Okay, then.
I'm out of here!
- 好吧，那么。
我要离开这里了！

09:01.833 --> 09:04.100
See ya!
Yahoo!
再见！
雅虎！

09:04.200 --> 09:08.067
[laughing]
[笑]

09:08.167 --> 09:09.200
I win!
我赢了！

09:09.300 --> 09:12.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:12.567 --> 09:15.100
You can never have
too many!
你永远不可能拥有
太多了！

09:15.200 --> 09:17.067
Hey, Squiddy-bird!
嘿，乌贼鸟！

09:17.167 --> 09:18.300
- Whoo...
- 呼...

09:18.400 --> 09:19.867
Having lots of fun
over here.
玩得很开心
在这里。

09:19.967 --> 09:21.533
I've got a plate...
我有一盘...

09:21.633 --> 09:23.500
that's made of paper.
那是纸做的。

09:23.600 --> 09:24.967
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:25.067 --> 09:27.767
It's a paper plate.
Whoo.
这是一个纸盘。
呼。

09:27.867 --> 09:29.133
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:30.833 --> 09:32.133
Well, if it's good enough
for Mr. Krabs,
好吧，如果它足够好的话
对于蟹老板来说，

09:32.233 --> 09:33.233
it's good enough for me.
这对我来说已经足够好了。

09:33.333 --> 09:35.067
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:35.133 --> 09:37.833
- I have to say, Mr. Plankton,
if this is how
- 我不得不说，浮游生物先生，
如果是这样的话

09:37.933 --> 09:39.467
you treat your employees--
你对待你的员工——

09:39.567 --> 09:41.733
- Say no more, my friend.
- 别再说了，我的朋友。

09:41.833 --> 09:45.100
If you'd care to work for me,
just sign this contract
如果你愿意为我工作
只要签署这份合同

09:45.200 --> 09:46.900
with this delicious
candy pen.
有了这个美味
坎迪半岛

09:47.067 --> 09:48.733
- Ooh, me first!
Me first!
- 哦，我先来！
我先！

09:48.833 --> 09:51.933
- Oh, don't bother to read it,
not on such a fun day.
-哦，不用费心去读它，
不是在这么有趣的一天。

09:52.067 --> 09:54.800
- That's such great advice!
- 这真是个好建议！

09:54.900 --> 09:56.133
- [slurping noises]
- [吸吮声]

09:56.233 --> 09:58.833
- This is working far better
than I planned.
- 这效果要好得多
比我计划的要多。

09:58.933 --> 10:01.467
With Krabs as my employee,
I can order him
有了螃蟹作为我的员工，
我可以命令他

10:01.567 --> 10:03.133
to give me
the Krabby Patty formula,
给我
蟹黄饼配方，

10:03.233 --> 10:05.200
and the Krusty Krab
will be no more.
和蟹堡王
将不再有。

10:05.300 --> 10:06.200
[evil cackling]
[邪恶的咯咯声]

10:06.300 --> 10:08.533
- [clears throat]
Hello, Plankton.
- [清喉咙]
你好，浮游生物。

10:08.633 --> 10:10.800
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

10:10.900 --> 10:12.533
- Mr. Krabs,
don't sign it!
- 蟹老板先生，
别签！

10:12.633 --> 10:14.067
[yells]
[喊叫]

10:15.367 --> 10:17.967
- My candy pen!
- 我的糖果笔！

10:18.067 --> 10:21.033
- [slow motion]
Simmy, look out!
- [慢动作]
西米，小心！

10:21.133 --> 10:24.300
There's a candy pen headed
straight for your eye
有一支糖果笔头
直达你的眼睛

10:24.400 --> 10:27.500
due to my act of swatting
it away without first
由于我的殴打行为
没有先它就走

10:27.600 --> 10:29.933
considering the trajectory.
考虑到轨迹。

10:30.033 --> 10:33.500
Oh, I wish I could get my words
out faster, but everything
哦，我希望我能得到我的话
出得更快，但一切

10:33.600 --> 10:35.767
is in slow motion.
是慢动作。

10:35.867 --> 10:38.867
[yells]
No!
[喊叫]
不！

10:40.567 --> 10:48.500
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:48.600 --> 10:49.733
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:52.000 --> 10:54.533
Simmy and Tally
are holograms?
西米和塔利
是全息图？

10:54.633 --> 10:58.133
Then that means...
那么这意味着...

10:58.233 --> 10:59.867
- I was riding that?
- 我骑的是那个？

11:00.067 --> 11:02.900
What about those delicacies
I was eating?
那些美食呢
我在吃饭吗？

11:07.567 --> 11:10.200
[yelling]
[大喊]

11:12.400 --> 11:13.867
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

11:13.967 --> 11:15.933
Phew, that was a close--
唷，那是一个结束——

11:16.067 --> 11:18.200
Ah!
啊!

11:18.300 --> 11:19.733
You saved me, boy.
你救了我，孩子。

11:19.833 --> 11:21.333
How did you do it?
你是怎么做到的？

11:21.433 --> 11:24.067
- I guess my mind was all
sharp from the relaxing fun
- 我想我脑子里全是
轻松的乐趣中锐利

11:24.100 --> 11:28.200
I had at your company picnic,
Mr. Krabs.
我在你们公司野餐，
蟹老板。

11:28.300 --> 11:29.967
- Unbelievable!
- 难以置信！

11:30.067 --> 11:31.200
Uh-oh...
呃-哦...

11:33.333 --> 11:35.333
[screaming]
[尖叫]

11:35.433 --> 11:36.600
[explosion booms]
[爆炸声]

11:36.700 --> 11:38.733
- The greatest company
picnic ever!
- 最伟大的公司
永远野餐！

11:38.833 --> 11:41.133
- All right, enough relaxing,
back to work.
- 好吧，足够放松了，
回去工作。

11:41.233 --> 11:42.933
[chuckles]
[笑声]

11:47.167 --> 11:50.200
[upbeat maritime music]
【欢快的航海音乐】

【欢快的航海音乐】